/eval/context_remediation_v1/diagnostics/**/*report.md
/eval/context_remediation_v1/diagnostics/**/final_review.md
/eval/context_remediation_v1/diagnostics/**/manual_review_findings.json

# 诊断脚本生成的大型历史案例由本地重建，不跟踪展开后的数据。
